<view class="goal-setup-page watercolor-page">
  <view class="page-pad">
    <view class="setup-heading"><view class="tag">并行目标</view><view class="page-title">开启一条并行路线</view><view class="page-subtitle">先告诉 Agent 你想走到哪里，它会搜索资料并把选择权交还给你。</view></view>
    <view class="setup-card card">
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">长期目标</text><textarea class="field-control textarea" data-key="title" value="{{title}}" placeholder="例如：30 天完成一套数据分析作品集" bindinput="onInput"></textarea><text class="error" wx:if="{{errors.title}}">{{errors.title}}</text></view>
      <view class="picker-row"><view class="picker-cell"><text class="field-label">持续多久</text><input class="field-control" type="number" data-key="days" value="{{days}}" bindinput="onInput"/><text class="error" wx:if="{{errors.days}}">{{errors.days}}</text></view><view class="picker-cell"><text class="field-label">每日可投入</text><picker range="{{timeOptions}}" bindchange="timeChange"><view class="picker-value">{{dailyTime}}⌄</view></picker></view></view>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">你目前的状态</text><picker range="{{levelOptions}}" range-key="label" bindchange="levelChange"><view class="picker-value">{{currentLevel==='BEGINNER'?'刚开始接触':currentLevel==='SPRINT'?'短期冲刺':'有基础但不成体系'}}⌄</view></picker></view>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">偏好的资料形式</text><picker range="{{sourceOptions}}" range-key="label" bindchange="sourceChange"><view class="picker-value">{{sourcePreference==='VIDEO'?'视频课程':sourcePreference==='TEXT'?'教材 / 文档':sourcePreference==='PRACTICE'?'练习 / 项目':'让 Agent 判断'}}⌄</view></picker></view>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">资料访问偏好</text><picker range="{{accessOptions}}" range-key="label" bindchange="accessChange"><view class="picker-value">{{accessPreference==='PAID_OK'?'可接受付费':accessPreference==='OWNED'?'我已有资料':'仅免费'}}⌄</view></picker></view>
      <view class="setup-note"><text>✦</text><view><view class="note-title">先选择，再开始</view><view class="hint">Agent 会展示公开可访问的来源组合和第一周计划。你不确认，任务不会进入今日航线。</view></view></view>
      <view class="setup-actions"><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="back">取消</button><button class="primary-button" bindtap="submit">开始搜索来源</button></view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
